        "category": "classfeature",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>♑ The Capricorn Cloth.</strong> <em>[OFFENSE, conditional]</em></p><h3>Cloth Passive — The Sword Arm &amp; The Sharpest Sword</h3><p><strong>The Sword Arm.</strong> Your unarmed Strikes gain the <strong>versatile S</strong> and <strong>deadly d8</strong> traits. You are trained in Athletics.</p><p><strong>The Sharpest Sword.</strong> Your critical hits with unarmed Strikes <strong>sever</strong> — the target permanently loses the use of one limb, natural attack, or sense of your choice until it receives <em>regenerate</em>. You also gain the <strong>sword group critical specialization</strong> with all your Strikes.</p><h3>Techniques</h3><ul><li><strong>1st &mdash; Signature (L1)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Excalibur]</li><li><strong>2nd (L6)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Jumping Stone]</li><li><strong>3rd &mdash; Cloth Ability (L11)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Double Excalibur]</li><li><strong>4th &mdash; Ultimate (L16)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Excalibur: The Sword That Cuts Everything]</li></ul><h3>Ascendant Boon — Excalibur Cuts Everything <em>[OFFENSE, conditional]</em></h3><p>Your unarmed Strikes <strong>ignore all resistances, physical immunities, and Hardness</strong>, and gain <strong>+1 damage die</strong>.</p><p>You may Strike incorporeal creatures and force effects; a critical hit destroys a force effect.</p><hr /><p><strong>GM note, print this:</strong> Capricorn is a <em>key, not a hammer</em> — its value swings from +0% against a boss with no resistances to +170% against resistance 10. On the day Capricorn rises, ask your GM what's behind the wall; and GMs, seed something resistant, or the boon is a shrug.</p><p>Applied by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-effects.Item.Sky: Ascendant (Capricorn)]</p><h3>Zenith Boon — Excalibur Cuts Everything (Zenith) <em>[OFFENSE, conditional]</em></h3><p>As the Ascendant Boon, plus a <strong>reaction</strong> (once per turn per creature): a creature attacks you or a spell effect enters your space &rarr; you <strong>sever it</strong>, and it has no effect.</p><p>Applied by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-effects.Item.Sky: Zenith (Capricorn)]</p>"
        },
